  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "不風不雨，白日皎皎，宜出驅馳，通利大道。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cc35c547b423712b583b6f71e637d376f390f2a2b0ad550be2ba72c3efa969e9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a06e60371cd255bc4058c1d0fa023110dc29a11c8f82710f0f9875a3370d1a35"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "谷風布氣，萬物出生，萌庶長養，華葉茂盛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0e3cc4449a86689dbbc8d8b75e3ef23208a882faa949eb2bf20570301ef36f66",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:399ecf81c38606c1b03a5da035a2b8f26c51ad614fcf8da59752edc0e5dd27d6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "蒼龍單獨，與石相觸，摧折兩角，室家不足。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:80c03b1c02acc18460f0b81b67eb7ab734747a55e857556a7bbbee50e1aafab3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:83cf79c8c6423a5f31c0fa6406a71958bb3df23d25e0b23c6df16c6ebbfb5251"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "城上有烏，自名破家，招呼酖毒，為國災患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4c52ae988113accdaf2016a8e15cb3f252f3c480d202e813ec992b60033c7c0e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0c02eb3e125f14b272ebbb989ac6873d6b5fbeb9b2815e885a7845fea5ec08bd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "霜降閉戶，蟄虫隱處，不見日月，與死為伍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8e039e515ea5cd11fe2e9a901e5e116c0daa1e902fcc7dd591299a0a6bae6a1f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d89bd5f1f7de4d20c35fa6dd92f0ddf2c7e74ffb89fc3923980b0e6ff884fa54"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "天之德室，溫仁受福，衣裳所在，凶惡不起。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c74ef66fa1dcb561d2bcb827e91b83e273cc5fc5d669fcab274a1d35ba9a24b1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:62c2b06e6e252d00db6b8d561bf37f2c88b1f2235107cf6f9419d57cc5628f92"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "皇陛九重，絕不可登，謂天蓋高，未見王公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d658bb0e0aa9cc23733d81651821ba6da4badbd91bc158bb4c66b9585b0498a0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c6409b579265480ff57b89773eea6d0b20ed108896551ece43a80d279eabfd33"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "孔德如玉，出于幽谷，飛上喬木，鼓其羽翼，輝光照國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:03c2c2f81a6fb8dc56239e646e2e232a900c67d2ccc6e60ce60f24d15e2c73a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:80b39ec827339663c5706d8716001ebce3c7602d02c9c7bcd81ffd50a69ecf67"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "五範四軌，復得饒有，陳力就列，騶虞悅喜。四足無角，君子所服，南征述職，以惠我國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e4ecfe171c5ff5d8dfd4e2381afd3fb3498dc715bf44e97574d25890b5861779",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bb8aeb1f92e13fd07b6ff42f55c90e9a1c21dd1d8e07147a502f9e87b28cda0d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "敝笱在梁，魴逸不禁，漁父勞苦，連室乾口。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cc27fa0d63e6b72a9dc0cb0b4ee9ca6965e52d3dafdefc8423c29d1c7b9a9fd5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d3e9476357820fe9e47df496a564361c6c8af7e85199bcbe6d59db80d52b0d09"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "雷行相逐，無有攸息，戰于平陸，為夷所覆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3c1903c887b6d97bca3d7e21d92032e1decdca4e48820a9751e5d24244fd627e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dfc957d899a1aa6c1dd78c567e4caffbf5bc5722a52b64231314fe555848617e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "六龍爭極，服在不飾，謹慎管鑰，結禁無出。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e6b486d1dbc76047f053162d175d7c7f43a92eedfbb58b0ef86268921544fbe6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1309d0ed14f0e1723560d63b900673e1130a7c358572b245c1585ddae472bc70"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "長男少女，相向共語，析薪在尅，福祿歡喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:12715085233f3ae5ce8b7cd71f8fcdd02208949a2abe96610bbb1f022bc248ae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c2f7587007940b56b04db640a99a6691c45dfdb88feb01187f4077687083fae0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "遷延惡人，使德不通，炎火為殃，禾稼大傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0764864ac953fff659920cf375e7cfd558e5206d7dbec9ff509155ec05d0bf77",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c0195425a14be1207a8fdfb74c63592b96a240d8a5a7741e24b6a439ce90a953"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "修其翰翼，隨風向北，至虞夏國，與舜相得，年歲大樂，邑無盜賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c7bd231a1791bc43c48629a3f35bc3a88c6cb28615f44dcb3f02447781cfc3de",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:24778e567842e17ccb7bedd3c8f1bc502e64b3e0061c0b350fb93e4ac753531d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "鈆刀攻玉，堅不可得，盡我筋力，胝繭為疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:96b04734bd58553dd587e1173aefbc41c5269cbb63047bfaa30a33bf3da12453",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1ed7a55a6792d0789c44766ffdc748ce30bb94dc87cc23034a7e29f712d02169"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "舉袂覆目，不見日月，衣裳簠簋，就長夜室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:46d0837101c7b81ed64e1bb23ed45235c7cc3bc47a8a6c00d88c571e04cbb17a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1fbdaf06f51028ed7189f817e4f165b7547858c64352ebb9605fcf9ebe48718c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "賊仁傷德，天怒不福，斬刈宗社，失其邦域。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:69be68e6038368943993dee24dce915ccf52a220cb5d7674f5e9ee0c94958a40",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c0992c0f3924392587e2b79c16cfc5820c35626a9e38d42815797188ec89712f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "白龍赤虎，戰鬪俱怒，蚩尤敗走，死於魚口。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2b13d2e5aad5f4bad4fe4b45b0cfc0f75aee10b5dca40992a8da4948c586c902",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0f5e132fc0e26de592e49053951f867b59201a7b70278e7a6db27e647f9da2d3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "北辰紫宮，衣冠立中，含和建德，常受天福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3cc9b8b34d1b7f5c50323be45d5e03ba1b96496478010d7dcca26a90b741f9b0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ffa6750ef63774a0bf9b52db602b263e20f9f376559a62376169d895f2a5bce0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "稷為堯使，西見王母，拜請百福，賜我嘉子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f2fc3a95967ed3b4e2bc12b040b3eff6197436beb9ea162696180ea01931fdec",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:92ae074e2baf3b8cc4f40bac1fcc96fea14eba2c8b43a1efc82c053c2423e573"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "三人異趣，反覆迷惑，一身五心，亂無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9c3b4baf807a46eee8aa798bc53b1f14b2a6bbfdf9b47e91acb825c406c8baae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ab84a858da672be70cd07e16e39d5efe0bf3f83f40dcd53ae3da4c05c29f0389"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "南山大玃，盜我媚妾，怯不敢逐，退而獨宿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2ab7c1f662c3a422e7a98cea61847b513dbc3f6026c05c0c86c714a133907768",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7a564f1ed14f0744b45e6f48101ab22c1089ff2b814aea23c005d144ece36bd5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "眾尤所逐，反作光怪，九身無頭，魂驚魄去，不可以居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3a4f2cad52368a4a1e7da5e9a02724661a8347175e840de09925a0ad997a406c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cd168975b38de13f577677d4b95438ebc6cf52e826dffb52c0abc4b49590e392"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "延頸遠望，昧為目病，不見叔姬，使伯心憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2bbe1107277da0937e4696aae48a23512fb82b5ed71af91b6a8f099056652e49",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3403fa9623a7b86dd488a4e7ba2410ae4e801d0b0f25227ef3216f9a39308829"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "典冊法書，藏在蘭臺，雖遭亂潰，獨不遇災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d180047772b830f458cced88b9741833587aaf8f9f56c831c1aa0cc9deb14735",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:66ecf8626ca258de829f1d7f2345e1d18f76faac7ce3916a97316fba853e9ccb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "自衛反魯，時不可與，冰炭異室，仁道隔塞。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d2ee2b512ade73fe83372cea2fa0d6012c40177a7f04c31efc539ecd259ffa2b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3d61f6b70ebcc820adda8cb70bfb74c44f783666a5c2dba8c0a97cd0841729cf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "瘤癭禿疥，為身瘡害，疾病癃殘，常不屬遠。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:edb2853a26a45a6e9577ecb0f9a624aeb88e114029af557ea73de88bf6837e2d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e6e140f983af15d68952cd4e1f4c514b1d3a6a8faa4d39a8d1850baf1b29a4dc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "東齊郭廬，嫁於洛都，俊良美好，媒利過倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:845cfabea861ab2af5bd34f806cb465eabfe30d567d3e319e43e90dc9d48626c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1dbf0bd830936906f3af9934b8514617e2bb46c16f655e09894d2de244188bc8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "齊魯爭言，戰於龍門，構怨連禍，三世不安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cbc8c32c635fc6a10ed44a56e19ca4a6387f28a3e533d068248661037a256ff2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f546a82a7919310d06af6ea790c29fdc9e4db6cc2fc3597cba78828246f3e591"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "膏澤肥壤，農人豐敞，利居長安，歷世無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0b5d89e20a9220de7779f577a30abe437ea631de87a20fddd30c5f9d3709e0cc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a99235f443d3b954a83d459fae22766bd2bf1f61444eb7bfe2fa5e09e5b93bf5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "倉盈庾億，宜種黍稷，年豐歲熟，民得安息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:001562af80da698c78fd0f30cce6f3faeddc0c52ba9252dbddec184402d4ad9c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c8cc172f13341b7f1235c9d84593e902954c6c04bdfbbee26d2b071201c292ca"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "鴟鴞破斧，邦人危殆，賴旦忠德，轉禍為福，傾危復立。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e904bc3e8d7570fce318deae3e0b20e75f59961a4c662d3cbbabd12e810c2d8d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ba5e1c704567d1cc35d3a909e4b24d5d11d3a56525872fbfe3166565c9302f54"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "歲飢無年，虐政害民，乾溪驪山，泰楚結冤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2e4b40faa350642c24bfe32464d73fda4d59ed1c8785e2beb14fa3ed175eb5d1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b34d2b938004125882b1615feaca596ebf8261ef8b44fff5c966dcfe0ecab36b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "挒潔累累，締結難解，嫫母衒嫁，媒不得坐，自為身禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:33017b1ae181d893039fb74bad1babf2d38f10f46ba2fcb7868a0cb61bb764ce",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6c3c23cf97af3735559fbfea56d28ac3df67d67f4865f15d7ddffc2a8d14f8ce"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "訾陬開門，鶴鳴彈冠，章甫進用，舞韶和鸞，三人翼事，國無災患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:25eaf6b463ea0ee197f24b334e9abea55f4d8381853cf7981ce69dbbef939c58",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:89859ad06f1a824644ffeb8d7253d478d8c58c17c55a1f7c20cde819635d4447"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "姊妹本居，與類相扶，願慕群醜，不離其友。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6dc20a0468ea4ba1cf2b0a5399df60afa7a87e03d8ec033a1cc122c2caaeae7f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:132d1b8ff04dbb9b5330b45f71d5aae525175ed67ece13d5133ca8751d1e1ba4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "邯鄲反言，父兄生患，涉此憂恨，卒死不還。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0d0ad6c34c08ea7cb22b99d2a231ad3c01d7a43d061553405c5285ccc5ec2755",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:09350af34f63757df62a4c198165269c3d14c6165fd699f791eac8141e5356b5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "二人逐兔，各爭其得，愛妾善走，多獲其子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:06b3e25faf697a5ba99251561df9337e43890bec0486d54caf8915f9fff769a3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:170bbac1bccabe6100e729f30e2d52de6df7152437e601ddf127b2b67e79fecb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "北辰紫宮，衣冠立中，含和建德，常受天福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:235763fd7dab8c1ede89acea4d07de2ea4c1c9807eaed77f344bb07ea7d1b310",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ffa6750ef63774a0bf9b52db602b263e20f9f376559a62376169d895f2a5bce0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "拜跪請免，不得其哺，俛守銜枚，低頭北去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:029dca537bba609153026790ac1918d2cc1bbfcc04ff044d07976e6f89b26cdc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:290787986a53951c35689dac3d9f5d2ef6b24d2b55fd2f6379c3a0602c6413bf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "鶴盜我珠，逃於東隅，求我郭墟，不見所居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6b6bbbab5274ad21cd8c7f8e22fb392c4e50e8fb0bc79611e0efa094fbb29c2b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5253d1dbb521cc9bf79db35fa6cab52d8abb3c1415544c95eb451c95ee66bee0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "一簧兩舌，妄言謀訣，三姦成虎，曾母投杼。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:de312e95d52abec90a95572e5c52cc2f49d09fa8cfede7307b894a36ea68e028",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:382b9f3de4c6af3c95e95f253e2cdabcb197bcabb46c57c604dbb55d3a72bb90"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "伯虎仲熊，德義洵美，使布五穀，陰陽順序。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:852fcaf65cf6bcd95ea7f2b9abc52a18a81d1802b58be95def0a965b4a5afd0a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c7d475d40aed3bfbcf4d46fa6572dfc544a0d9256fa30459f338deb9dc7626e0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "褰衣涉河，澗流浚多，賴遇舟子，濟脫無它。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:500122fd95df4deeb3c71a3c6a5174e433b51c4a34d1d2f65820082b94a260ce",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a98a624fb08f5ac2520ef64412c1cc62826601555527623a136b338f406103c1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "憑河登山，道路阻難，求事少便。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8c8d3698aea0a2bda2de4946d45e0d46ca8df9075a422f3f690bbf3250f83d3a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f462f30f63c67a543d059219d48bf6bf884175ad403e3b9c8a91e8691f54c974"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "兔罝之容，不失其恭，和謙致樂，君子攸同。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f81545c8fc5cfda3b0397c76953b053c2f73ce8f38762792e17940eac1114126",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:420d9617a447b2a94ecafcedd38c8e6b950d009b92eb3a839f194a1850215fd6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "三女求夫，伺候山隅，不見復關，泣涕漣洳。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9d3b21db6082f6e01c3bae6d24a323df92923773d4a3ed78930bb27fd76f0b6c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7b2406670a50552f67426c6ecb3717055765c64aedcddfc9fcffd189dd502aeb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "螟蟲為賊，害我五穀，簞笥空虛，家無所食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:17e164d59a57e357dfefe1aaa38aef93aaef246837c0486f789a8afd52b90ccd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c9d7a7f8f76f274af428b247b8d6d71c821811bb56ce5106b2891c69edfde06a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "望尚阿衡，太宰周公，藩屏輔弼，福祿來同。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ec7cacd59a0ee5e91b6adec615dd8bed24002698f20fa1e284a42b60b5b4ef4e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:941e1d8227784450be61c3e3f072b06e598eb2bc408a5461b637ce31df94bd0d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "三年生狗，以戌其母，荊夷上侵，姬伯出走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c4d2ce078cc958eb9e27c4750b038ed2f31568e7790ee00d6db87e0eaf0e61d3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:73b803cb1575d5f8a4092ac6cb05309166cbbcc5d3be6f1ec1b71b3b3f9dac25"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "塗回道塞，求事不得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9c527f8f93f763a7bd7ee8b6c3debb218f205bdf04bdddc3f31789ad7dd1f4cd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f9453149aef502ffbebfc5943535984bfb009e6a2c386b737c9dc7e74f3bd5f9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "探懷得蚤，所願失道。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:75a83abb10a640661946e4307d69f1292ef7c44573138a661048da75dfe99bc3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e003fa325723ead71a233e85bc92e077b30bdce4aab5748951057a21ce571251"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "飛蟻遇道，趾多擾垣，居之不安，覆厭為患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fffbb87f4890d66c7048f86423c127644d9cef8c641c81e340d9d1479db32405",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:21719ef5584b8cd3b69114d2e37ac9384748d23fe41f5c73e28528e8c8f3dd3d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "義不勝情，以欲自傾，幾危利寵，折角摧頸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:48c04ec975b02e1a44ec16b8da9683cd99d8af0d046a4971893daca88f361819",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:01f92c0c5b1ebddf3ff12659491857e99f7e27f3c2437bfcba24bc9bf8e34ca5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "潼滃蔚薈，扶首來會，津液下降，流潦滂霈。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5879778c7bcae9f9c133e72102c993f56d8d1a83742b1c8dc3452ef4dea30782",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6617344f47bc2e93b1ec59b28a1c04025d74f8de31a9e03836f51f1f91ce0f7e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "白駒生芻，猗猗盛姝，赫喧君子，樂以忘憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0ecbb2a52544417a0b56fafc02050830351c0ac3474a9acfe33a6f7000055311",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:110944666d4d271492ed6d2a6a57aadcfffd1366a11563d34c13ea0a5f3076c0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "車馳人趨，卷甲相仇，齊魯寇戰，敗於犬丘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:88cc0556c0059958ac857e1b65462f9d04d3ac6d03ff1e5b25195a7ff87e0c8c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2350a81d783332295a85fa9d6d35b6aa381e769d4593e94a2f7281a9783adcc4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "舉首望城，不見子貞，使我悔生。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:85060b6ffa8d1040dae187f1512e441216e4b945669f937f9a84d8f8422c73f5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8caa22d8bf50e4ca90811a1434101394e1dec40a0601cc51501cfd529aa475b1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "龍鬪時門，失理傷賢，內畔生賊，則生禍難。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:56d08fdc57186b216ee8b8dcf0bd26e50d290b4e30eef8ac2838925c931a00fe",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:39d3672b74c95e41835a2a1070d598c4deedfba72a4755f98a11a883ec38d74d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "安如泰山，祿祐履臻，雖有豹虎，不敢危身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4b8b24919e7da05850d895a6a24511a5df141a9414d47f807029cf1315f8f17b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f7b7572e29dc9f0dc0a7e6d08529a2377b7b56e2270ec2e7b708c910eed8642d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "初憂後喜，與福為市，八佾列陳，飲御嘉友。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8eaf875080742d105a8a6b8834184cbb83508623f75baf98674bdce57cbf5233",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a4d64390963cd3f282f944a969ed037ead87a7752720afb35ad4df6a4d7232f8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "持刀操肉，對酒不食，夫行從軍，小子入獄，抱膝獨宿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:52c6abbe65dee88d5fe11903539596fb9753c8c99e13cdc996c0c1cedb32ac7b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cdb556e4ba1ee92e15b6f38c1ac9481d2cc3e351754358dfa60ddd34d4c537df"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 2,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "陰衰老極，陽建其德，履離戴光，天下昭明，功業不長，蝦蟆大王。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d3b9675667c6a743a2a6419b0044899c328b3be088a08306bfe98909c761f572",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9882d9d1af043e63d1776a843c3b94efde1c6fa724297df5259e45082f54248e"
    }
  ]
}
